{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです！\nお元気ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はクリスマスイヴですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はお仕事がおやすみだったので\nお昼過ぎに起きて\nお昼ご飯に鰻を食べて\nお兄ちゃん抜きの家族で\nクリスマスケーキを食べ\nチップのお散歩にお兄ちゃん抜きで\n行ってきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、妹と2人で\nちょっとだけフラフラして\n家に帰ってきて\nまたクリスマスケーキをたべました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅいんてーる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はミュージックステーション\nスーパーライブでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は初めてのスーパーライブで\nいつもとは違うステージのつくりで\nライブと歌番組の間くらいの気持ちで\nいつもよりドキドキしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラの意味のMV衣装だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀北コンビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色違い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売された雑誌や\nこれから発売になる雑誌\n放送されるテレビ番組があるのですが\nまたまとめてからお知らせします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取り急ぎで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月23日 発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zipper WINTER号"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はアウター企画と\n連載のひなコレクションに\n載せてもらってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方にZipperを\n手にとってもらえたら嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/25/9706997/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファーコートがとても\nかわいいでございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/fi